QUESTION 2 – MINIMUM / MAXIMUM
========================================

13. Procedure paste karo:

CREATE OR REPLACE PROCEDURE min_max_numbers(
 num1 NUMERIC,
 num2 NUMERIC
)
LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $$
BEGIN
 IF num1 > num2 THEN
  RAISE NOTICE 'Maximum: %, Minimum: %', num1, num2;
 ELSE
  RAISE NOTICE 'Maximum: %, Minimum: %', num2, num1;
 END IF;
END;
$$;


14. Run:

CALL min_max_numbers(10, 20);

Output:
NOTICE: Maximum: 20, Minimum: 10
